@NswagToolchain_HostAddress = http://localhost:5147

### 1. Get Swagger UI
GET {{NswagToolchain_HostAddress}}/swagger

### 2. Get ReDoc UI
GET {{NswagToolchain_HostAddress}}/redoc

### 3. Get OpenAPI V1 JSON Spec
GET {{NswagToolchain_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json

### 4. Get All Tasks
GET {{NswagToolchain_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Accept: application/json

### 5. Filter Tasks by Status (InProgress)
GET {{NswagToolchain_HostAddress}}/api/tasks?status=InProgress
Accept: application/json

### 6. Create New Task
POST {{NswagToolchain_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Write Unit Tests for Payment Gateway",
  "description": "Achieve 95% code coverage for payment processing logic.",
  "priority": "High",
  "assigneeEmail": "qa-lead@company.com",
  "dueDate": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### 7. Generate C# Client SDK on-the-fly
GET {{NswagToolchain_HostAddress}}/api/client-gen/csharp
Accept: application/json

### 8. Generate TypeScript Client SDK on-the-fly
GET {{NswagToolchain_HostAddress}}/api/client-gen/typescript
Accept: application/json
